bmdwire is four independently licensed packages in one repository. Each
package directory carries its own license file, which governs everything
under it:

    atemwire/        LGPL-3.0-only   atemwire/LICENSE, atemwire/LICENSE-gpl3.txt
                                     and atemwire/NOTICE (a fork of pyatem)
    hyperdeckwire/   MIT             hyperdeckwire/LICENSE
    ultimattewire/   MIT             ultimattewire/LICENSE
    videohubwire/    MIT             videohubwire/LICENSE

Everything outside those four directories (this file, README.md, the
workflows) is MIT, under the same terms as hyperdeckwire/LICENSE.
